WEBVTT

00:07:26.935 --> 00:07:32.505
is giving everyone in India one day
a chance to carry a smartphone

00:07:32.505 --> 00:07:34.365
with full connectivity.

00:07:34.365 --> 00:07:38.745
I think doing that can make
a really big difference in people's lives.

00:07:38.745 --> 00:07:42.415
We are working very hard to make
smartphones cheaper

00:07:42.415 --> 00:07:45.845
and more affordable and something
we are working very hard on.

00:07:46.375 --> 00:07:49.215
We want to get it to rural India
as much as possible.

00:07:49.225 --> 00:07:51.685
So we have this program called
'Internet Saathi'

00:07:51.685 --> 00:07:57.325
where we work with Tata Trust and
we train women in rural Indian villages.

00:07:57.325 --> 00:08:00.345
We have been doing this 
across hundred thousand villages